<title>BELGIUM: Iomega says drive shipments reach 10 mln.</title>
<headline>Iomega says drive shipments reach 10 mln.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1997-07-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Iomega International SA, a unit of Iomega Corp, said in a statement global shipments of the firm's computer data storage drives had exceeded 10 million.</p>
<p>Iomega said shipments included more than seven million Zip drives, one million Jaz drives and two million Ditto drives.</p>
<p>The company said shipments should rise further in the second half of 1997 with Zip drives being included in a number of manufacturers' notebook computers and the scheduled fourth quarter launch of new versions of its tape backup Ditto Max drives and cartridges.</p>
<p>-- Brussels Newsroom +32 2 287 6810, Fax +32 2 230 7710</p>
